"answer": "Project Zenith is a multi-phase initiative with varying details across different communications. It was introduced as a data analytics revolution (content:01) and a cloud storage optimization project (content:02). Key milestones include the completion of the testing phase (content:03) and the design phase, leading into development (content:05) and prototype testing for secure file sharing (content:07). Leadership roles are attributed to Sarah Tan, Marcus Cole, and Omar Jensen. Budget updates show an initial allocation of $500,000 (content:01), an adjustment to $550,000 (content:06), a specific compliance plan budget of $55,000 (content:08), and a final executive approval of $2M (content:09). The project involves various teams and external partners, with onboarding sessions and kickoff meetings scheduled throughout 2023."
